---
import PhotographyLayout from '../../layouts/PhotographyLayout.astro';

const photos = [
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/0.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/1.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/2.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/3.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/4.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/5.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/6.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/7.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/8.jpg",
    "/image/Photography/Decisive/9.jpg"
];
---

<PhotographyLayout
    title={"Decisive Moment"}
    subtitle={"Photography | Hong Kong"}
    ogDescription={"A street photography series from Hong Kong capturing decisive moments — the simultaneous recognition of significance and precise visual composition."}
    image={"https://xdd44.xyz/image/Photography/Decisive/0.jpg"}
>
    <div class="container">
        <p style="padding-top: 15vh;">
            &quot;To me, photography is the simultaneous recognition , in a fraction of a second, of the significance of an event, as well as of a precise organization of forms which give that event its proper expression.&quot;
        </p>
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
        <p>-- Henri Cartier-Bresson --</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <p style="padding-top: 20vh;">
            By the term &quot;Decisive Moment&quot;, Henri Cartier-Bresson tried to defined the action of capturing something deep and meaningful with photography. Through my wandering in streets, I also noticed such &quot;moments&quot;. I successfully captured some
            of them, incorporating my own understanding, and telling the stories of Hongkongers without words.
        </p>
    </div>
    {photos.map(src => (
        <div class="container">
            <img src={src} />
        </div>
    ))}
</PhotographyLayout>
